this repository, unless a file says otherwise.

"Licensor" means TGbox and its copyright holders.

"Official Service" means the TGbox service operated by the Licensor, including https://tgbox.cc,
the submission bot https://t.me/tgboxccbot and the admin application.

"Commercial Use" means any use intended for commercial advantage, monetization, business
operations, customer service, paid services, advertising, affiliate revenue, sponsorship, lead
generation, resale, or other revenue-generating activity.

"Public Hosted Service" means any website, SaaS, hosted application, bot, API, crawler service,
data service, directory, navigation site or similar service made available to third parties over
a network, whether access is paid or free.

"Competitive Service" means any Public Hosted Service that is the same as or substantially
similar to TGbox's product positioning, including Telegram channel, group and bot directories,
submission bots, navigation or search sites, and related data aggregation services.

2. Permitted Use

Subject to this license, you may:

- Read and study the source code.
- Copy, fork and modify the source code for personal learning, research, evaluation and local
  development.
- Deploy TGbox for your own personal use, where no one else can reach it.
- Deploy TGbox inside your own organization for internal, non-commercial use.
- Publish non-commercial patches or pull requests back to the official repository.
- Quote small excerpts of code or documentation for commentary, review or education, with
  attribution and a link to the official repository.

3. Restrictions

Without prior written permission from the Licensor, you may not:

- Use TGbox, a modified version of TGbox, or a derivative work of TGbox for Commercial Use.
- Operate TGbox, a modified version of TGbox, or a derivative work of TGbox as a Public Hosted
  Service.
- Operate a Competitive Service based on TGbox.
- Add advertising, affiliate links, sponsored placements, paid listings, paid traffic routing,
  paid data access, paid membership or other monetization to a deployment based on TGbox.
- Resell, rent, sublicense or offer TGbox as part of a commercial product or service.
- Use TGbox as a substitute data feed, bulk mirror, crawler target or dataset backend for
  another product.
- Remove or hide copyright, license, attribution or official project notices.
- Present any fork, mirror, hosted copy, derivative work or modified version as the Official
  Service.

4. Brand, Data and Content

This license applies to the software code in this repository only. It does not grant any right
to use the TGbox name, logo, icon, domain names (including tgbox.cc), visual identity,
screenshots, or any of the following, except as the Licensor allows in writing:

- production data, including the list of entries, categories and tags, translated descriptions,
